        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũthatu wa Yeova wakanĩa Isilaeli, nake amanengane mokonĩ ma anangi ala mamanangaa; na amathoosya mokonĩ ma amaitha moo ala mamathyũlũlũkĩte, mũvaka matyaatonya kũũngama ĩngĩ mbee wa amaitha moo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
